{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55120","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻贼去，大吉是其元。\n若在干（辛本、川本、京本作「前」）时应末去，若临干（辛本、川本、京本作「贼」）後是虚传，勿听此狂言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}